<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $193 mln repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $193 mln repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said it placed $193 million in overnight repurchase agreements Thursday.</p>
<p>The loans to local banks were set at nine percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, overnight interest rates eased to 6.875 from 7.0 percent at the close Wednesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar was steady at 0.99982 pesos.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
</text>
